                    "heading": "Most Common Questions",
                    "button_label": "",
                    "button_url": "",
                    "button_text_color": "",
                    "button_background_color": "",
                    "button_border_color": "",
                    "content": "<p><b>Question 1:</b> Can I personalize the gift book with my own photos and messages?<br><b>Answer 1:</b> Absolutely! The gift book includes space for personal photos, handwritten notes, and creative decorations, allowing you to customize it to suit your style and make it truly special.<br><br><b>Question 2:</b> Is this gift book sturdy and designed for repeated use?<br><b>Answer 2:</b> Yes. Made with high-quality paper, thick keepsake cardstock, and a sturdy spiral binding, this book is designed to be durable and reusable, serving as a treasured keepsake for years to come.<br><br><b>Question 3:</b> Will the gift book fit into a holiday stocking or be easy to give?<br><b>Answer 3:</b> Definitely. The compact 5x7 inch size makes it perfect for fitting into stockings or for easy hand delivery, adding a thoughtful touch to your holiday gifting.</p>",
                    "collapsible_font_heading_size": 16,
                    "collapsible_font_size": 12,
                    "coll_heading_color": "#000000",
